      "Wilds of Kanto or PokePC Followers can provide compatible Pokemon mount sprites",
      "Battle Art Voxel Fork and Dramaless Shape are optional voxel providers rather than flight requirements",
      "Battle Art remains preferred automatically if multiple supported voxel providers are active",
      "Dramaless uses J for Ground Ride because it reserves G for V-GRID; controller X/Y remain unchanged",
      "global FLIGHT SPEED and GROUND SPEED settings scale all mounts while retaining species profiles, boost and gallop",
