      "native 2D rider-plus-mount composition with deterministic rider-first mount-second draw order",
      "2D flight reuse of the existing Pokedex-proportional mount sizing and per-species size controls",
      "explicit renderer inspection through flightRendering and stadiumCompatibility",
      "Wilds of Kanto authoritative follower/sprite compatibility",
      "cooperative self-healing overworld update-hook protection for the Wilds/DSR/Deep Dive stack",
      "optional Flying Music integration with installed FRLG, HGSS and LGPE music packs without redistributing audio",
      "Charizard, Pidgeot, Fearow, Golbat, Aerodactyl, Articuno, Zapdos, Moltres, Dragonair and Dragonite flying mounts",
      "Arcanine, Rapidash, Dodrio, Rhyhorn, Rhydon, Kangaskhan, Tauros and Snorlax Ground Ride mounts",
      "visible Blastoise, Tentacruel, Gyarados and Lapras Surf mounts"
    },
    known = {
      "Pokemon Stadium Overworld Models still owns its own renderer and must honor DSR's explicit Stadium opt-in for full cross-mod 2D priority",
